     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Živjo, </div><div><br></div><div>da dopolnim obvestilo, 9.aprila pa so objavili <a href=\"http://blog.rstudio.org/2015/04/09/readr-0-1-0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://blog.rstudio.org/2015/04/09/readr-0-1-0/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237285527000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2NLqh_rD3hIGDOh4YMtfJp\">readr</a>, še prej pa <a href=\"http://blog.rstudio.org/2015/03/04/haven-0-1-0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://blog.rstudio.org/2015/03/04/haven-0-1-0/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237285527000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0fFSCwHELmE5QoLZRln4Pl\">haven</a>. </div><div><br></div><div>Na blogu pišejo, da &quot;<strong>readr</strong> makes it easy to read many types of tabular data...Compared to the equivalent base functions, readr functions are around 10x faster. They’re also easier to use because they’re more consistent, they produce data frames that are easier to use (no more <code>stringsAsFactors = FALSE</code>!), they have a more flexible column specification, and any parsing problems are recorded in a data frame&quot;, glede <strong>haven </strong>pa da &quot;makes it easy to read data from SAS, SPSS and Stata&quot;.</div><div><br></div><div>lep pozdrav, Miha</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2015-04-16 7:51 GMT+02:00  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rkoh...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;</span>:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:850px\">\r\n  <div style=\"padding:10px 20px;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">\r\n    <table style=\"width:100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"width:70%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:18px/20px arial;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\">\r\n              <a style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/rkoholiki/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/rkoholiki/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237285527000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ZwF8nuJ85aNjeGE_dJ0Ah\">\r\n              rkoh...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"width:30%;text-align:right\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:20px/24px arial;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal\"><a style=\"color:rgb(221,75,57);text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237285527000&amp;usg=AOvVaw23yG3p6a8odIM7Ww6BiyeG\">Google Groups</a></span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"width:32px\">\r\n            <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237285527000&amp;usg=AOvVaw23yG3p6a8odIM7Ww6BiyeG\"><img style=\"border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:middle\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/4SGWHe9midrWMDxDIJMQraTMMgnAU71soPZ0D28IOSZcs66TdyRoCqyIhaTt-kwo0YKv2lRo05RkwsGFZdnFhdvy60XdxNlL2U-B=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.google.com/images/icons/product/groups-32.png\"></a>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </tbod