;usg=AOvVaw0lVj9ANJ39SqZPug6mPyY0\">\r\n      nov paket za branje .xls(x) datotek\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n    \r\n      </font></span><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse\">\r\n    \r\n      <tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211);color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n        <span style=\"color:rgb(177,176,176);font-size:15px\">\r\n          romunov &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rom...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Apr 15 02:52PM +0200\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br><br>\r\n        Danes so na CRAN izobesili svež paket za branje xls in xlsx datotek.<br>\r\nProgramerji uporabljajo same bioeko knjižnice, kar pomeni, da ni zunanjih<br>\r\nodvisnosti od npr. Jave. Več o paketu na<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://blog.rstudio.org/2015/04/15/readxl-0-1-0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://blog.rstudio.org/2015/04/15/readxl-0-1-0/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237285527000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0R2wA8CzBL3aKBzpUKQtvk\">http://blog.rstudio.org/2015/04/15/readxl-0-1-0/</a><br>\r\n <br>\r\nlp,<br>\r\nRoman<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br>\r\n <br>\r\n-- <br>\r\nIn God we trust, all others bring data.<br>\r\n\r\n      </font></span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid rgb(211,211,211);color:rgb(46,46,46);font-family:arial;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n        <span style=\"color:rgb(177,176,176);font-size:15px\">\r\n          Crt Ahlin &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">crt....@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Apr 15 10:02PM +0200\r\n        </span>\r\n        <br><br>\r\n        Je že kdo preskusil kako deluje? Zanesljivost, hitrost...<br>\r\n <br>\r\nlpč<br>\r\n <br>\r\n\r\n      </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:40px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color